[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "turn_index": 0,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.657,
    "start": 0.0,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "大家好，欢迎来到《本体工程与知识图谱实战》第四集。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "turn_index": 0,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 7.924,
    "start": 3.657,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "上集我们写好了 Competency Questions，今天终于要打开 Protégé，但第一步不是点加号，而是把问题里的建模决定摆到桌面上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 0.305,
    "start": 11.581,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "对。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.324,
    "start": 11.886,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "今天的目标很具体：把 CQ-01 变成一个最小云服务本体，保存成 Turtle，关掉工具后再重新打开。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.362,
    "start": 18.21,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "能重现、能解释，才算真正交付。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "turn_index": 2,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 9.87,
    "start": 20.571,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "这条路要完成四次转换：从需求语言到概念表，从概念表到本体元素，从本体元素到 Protégé 操作，最后从界面里的修改到可维护的文件。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "turn_index": 3,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 7.314,
    "start": 30.441,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "同时我们会处理两个最容易混淆的问题：Amazon EC2 到底是类还是个体，以及 Domain 和 Range 到底是不是输入校验。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.777,
    "start": 37.755,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "先看 CQ-01：哪些计算服务支持 GPU，并在东京或新加坡区域可用？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.667,
    "start": 42.532,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "如果先不打开工具，你会怎样拆这句话？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 0.838,
    "start": 45.199,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "先看名词。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.781,
    "start": 46.037,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "计算服务对应 ComputeService，东京和新加坡属于 Region，答案还要给出厂商，所以需要 CloudProvider。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.952,
    "start": 52.818,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "再看动词和条件：服务由厂商提供、服务在区域可用、服务支持 GPU。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "turn_index": 6,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.876,
    "start": 57.77,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "于是关系候选是 hasProvider 和 hasRegion，布尔值候选是 hasGPU。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "turn_index": 6,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.638,
    "start": 62.647,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "产品文档地址和核验日期则更像维护信息，而不是业务世界里的对象关系。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.371,
    "start": 68.285,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "这就是概念表的价值。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.029,
    "start": 69.656,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "团队可以先讨论名称、粒度、答案形式和证据，再决定怎样在工具里表达。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.701,
    "start": 74.685,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "如果直接点击界面，很多决定会悄悄藏在操作历史里，后面很难评审。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.667,
    "start": 79.386,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "进入 Protégé 之前，还要分清五种元素。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.038,
    "start": 82.052,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "第一种是类，它描述一组对象，例如 ComputeService；"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "start": 86.09,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "第二种是个体，例如 AWS_EC2，它是一个可识别的具体云产品。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "start": 90.89,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第三种是对象属性，它连接对象和对象。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.648,
    "start": 94.09,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "AWS_EC2 hasProvider AWS，左右两端都是领域里的对象。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.714,
    "start": 98.738,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "第四种是数据属性，它把对象连接到字面量，例如 AWS_EC2 hasGPU true。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.6,
    "start": 104.452,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第五种是注释属性。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 7.695,
    "start": 106.052,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "rdfs:label 提供界面可读名称，rdfs:comment 写定义，dataSource 和 lastUpdated 记录证据与维护时间。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.743,
    "start": 113.748,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "它们很重要，但不参与 OWL 的逻辑推理。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "turn_index": 11,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.257,
    "start": 116.49,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "有人会反对：既然数据来源很重要，为什么不把它建成可以推理的普通属性？"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.21,
    "start": 121.748,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "因为要先问它是不是领域事实。"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.962,
    "start": 123.957,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "服务由哪个厂商提供，会改变我们对云服务世界的描述；"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.343,
    "start": 127.919,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "一个术语由哪份文档解释，更多是对模型和证据的说明。"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.495,
    "start": 132.262,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 3,
    "text": "把维护元数据混进业务关系，会让查询和推理边界变得模糊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 7.467,
    "start": 136.757,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "当然，未来如果要对来源本身建模，例如描述发布机构、许可证和证据版本，也可以把来源提升成领域对象。"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.495,
    "start": 144.224,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "但那是新的 CQ 驱动的新范围，不是看到一条 URL 就自动升级。"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "turn_index": 14,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 7.238,
    "start": 148.719,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "接着处理一个经典问题：ComputeService、Amazon EC2 和某个 GPU 实例规格，为什么不在同一层？"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.107,
    "start": 155.957,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "ComputeService 是类别，代表一组计算服务。"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.781,
    "start": 159.064,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "Amazon EC2 是产品级对象，我们希望在 CQ 的答案列表中直接返回它，所以当前把它建成个体。"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "start": 165.845,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "具体 GPU 实例系列或 SKU 更细，只有做规格和价格比较时才需要。"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "turn_index": 16,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.981,
    "start": 170.645,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "但产品名称也常被建成类。"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "turn_index": 16,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.781,
    "start": 172.626,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "比如有人会说 Amazon EC2 下面还有很多实例，所以 EC2 应该是类，这个说法并非完全错误吧？"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.276,
    "start": 179.407,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "没错，类与个体不是只看现实世界里有没有下级。"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.829,
    "start": 182.683,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "关键是当前模型怎样使用它。"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.029,
    "start": 184.511,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "如果要把每个 EC2 实例配置当作个体，Amazon EC2 可能成为产品系列类；"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.81,
    "start": 189.54,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 3,
    "text": "如果 CQ 只枚举产品目录里的服务，产品级个体更直接。"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.095,
    "start": 193.35,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "也就是说，这不是靠首字母大写、单复数或个人直觉决定，而是由答案粒度决定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.581,
    "start": 199.445,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "建模记录里还应该写清楚为什么暂时不展开 SKU。"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "turn_index": 19,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.905,
    "start": 203.026,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "对，而且这个决定可以演进。"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "turn_index": 19,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 8.61,
    "start": 204.93,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "等 CQ-05 真正要求同规格、同区域比较价格，我们再引入实例规格、计费周期和价格观测，不必在第一版预先建完整个云市场。"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "turn_index": 20,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.97,
    "start": 213.54,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "现在区分 TBox 和 ABox。"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "turn_index": 20,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.638,
    "start": 215.51,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "可以把 TBox 想成这门领域语言的词典与语法：有哪些类、属性和结构关系。"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "turn_index": 21,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.144,
    "start": 221.149,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "例如 ComputeService 是 CloudService 的子类，hasProvider 的主体属于 CloudService，客体属于 CloudProvider。"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "turn_index": 21,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.524,
    "start": 227.292,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "这些都在描述语言结构。"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "turn_index": 22,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 9.109,
    "start": 228.816,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "ABox 则用这门语言写具体事实：AWS_EC2 是 ComputeService，AWS_EC2 由 AWS 提供，而且在东京区域可用。"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "turn_index": 23,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "start": 237.925,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "要注意，TBox 和 ABox 是概念上的分工，不代表必须保存成两个文件。"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "turn_index": 23,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.105,
    "start": 242.725,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "我们的最小项目把结构和样例事实放在同一个 Turtle 文件里，方便演示和测试；"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "turn_index": 23,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.829,
    "start": 247.83,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "以后数据量变大再拆分。"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "turn_index": 24,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.067,
    "start": 249.658,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "终于打开 Protégé。"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "turn_index": 24,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.105,
    "start": 250.725,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "第一步选择 File、New，创建空本体，然后设置 Ontology IRI。"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "turn_index": 24,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.537,
    "start": 255.83,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "我们的本体 IRI 是项目级标识，实体使用同一命名空间和 cskg 前缀。"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "turn_index": 25,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 8.533,
    "start": 261.367,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第二步进入 Classes，先建 CloudService、CloudProvider 和 Region，再把 ComputeService、StorageService、DatabaseService 放到合适的子类位置。"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "turn_index": 25,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.752,
    "start": 269.9,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "先有骨架，再填细节。"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "turn_index": 26,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.952,
    "start": 271.652,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第三步分别进入 Object properties、Data properties 和 Annotation properties。"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "turn_index": 26,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.781,
    "start": 276.605,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "建立 hasProvider、hasRegion、hasGPU、dataSource 等属性，并补充标签、定义、Domain 和 Range。"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "turn_index": 27,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 7.771,
    "start": 283.386,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第四步进入 Individuals，添加 AWS、Azure、AWS_EC2、Azure_VM、东京和新加坡区域，再写类型和属性断言。"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "turn_index": 27,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.276,
    "start": 291.157,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "到这里，CQ-01 的查询所需元素才真正连起来。"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "turn_index": 28,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.029,
    "start": 294.433,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "界面里如果选择用 rdfs:label 渲染实体，看到的可能是中文标签。"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "turn_index": 28,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "start": 299.462,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "有人因此以为修改显示名称就是修改实体本身。"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.295,
    "start": 302.662,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "这是很危险的误解。"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.59,
    "start": 303.957,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "标签可以有多种语言，也可以随文案更新；"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.6,
    "start": 306.548,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "IRI 才是稳定标识。"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 7.619,
    "start": 308.148,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 3,
    "text": "最后用 File、Save As 保存成 Turtle，关闭后从本地文件重新打开，核对本体 IRI、前缀、实体和断言都还在。"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "turn_index": 30,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.676,
    "start": 315.767,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "现在说 Domain 和 Range。"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "turn_index": 30,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "start": 317.443,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "我们为 hasProvider 声明 Domain 是 CloudService，Range 是 CloudProvider。"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "turn_index": 30,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.952,
    "start": 322.243,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "很多人会把它理解成表单校验：左边只能填云服务，右边只能填厂商。"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "turn_index": 31,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.057,
    "start": 327.195,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "但 OWL 的核心含义是推理。"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "turn_index": 31,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 9.067,
    "start": 329.252,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "如果出现 x hasProvider AWS，推理机会据此得到 x 属于 CloudService、AWS 属于 CloudProvider，即使我们此前没有显式写出这些类型。"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "turn_index": 32,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.105,
    "start": 338.319,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "那如果我误把 Tokyo 写在 hasProvider 的右边，Protégé 为什么不一定马上拒绝？"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "turn_index": 33,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.562,
    "start": 343.424,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "因为在开放世界和 OWL 语义下，Range 会给 Tokyo 增加 CloudProvider 类型。"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "turn_index": 33,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.232,
    "start": 348.986,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "只有当模型还声明 Region 与 CloudProvider 不相交时，推理机才可能发现矛盾。"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "turn_index": 33,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.743,
    "start": 354.218,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "没有这些公理，它更可能接受新的类型推断。"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "turn_index": 34,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.581,
    "start": 356.961,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "所以把 Domain 和 Range 当数据库字段类型会产生错觉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "turn_index": 34,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "start": 360.542,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "它们能帮助分类和发现某些矛盾，却不能代替完整的数据质量规则。"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "turn_index": 35,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 0.305,
    "start": 365.342,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "对。"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "turn_index": 35,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 8.838,
    "start": 365.647,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "需要检查每条服务必须有一个厂商、日期格式是否合法、值是否来自允许列表时，更适合使用 SHACL 等验证语言。"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "turn_index": 35,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.942,
    "start": 374.485,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "第四集先记住边界，后面的质量章节再真正执行验证。"
  },
  {
